      "question": "If \\({\\left( {\\frac{{512}}{{125}}} \\right)^3} \\times {\\left( {\\frac{{512}}{{125}}} \\right)^k} = {\\left( {\\frac{8}{5}} \\right)^{15}} \\) , then k is:",
      "questionHtml": "If&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\({\\left( {\\frac{{512}}{{125}}} \\right)^3} \\times {\\left( {\\frac{{512}}{{125}}} \\right)^k} = {\\left( {\\frac{8}{5}} \\right)^{15}} \\)</span>, then k is:",
      "options": [
