      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p><strong><span class=\"math-tex\">\\({\\left( {\\frac{{512}}{{125}}} \\right)^3} \\times {\\left( {\\frac{{512}}{{125}}} \\right)^k} = {\\left( {\\frac{8}{5}} \\right)^{15}} \\)</span></strong> ⇒ <span class=\"math-tex\">\\({\\left( {\\frac{{512}}{{125}}} \\right)^{3+k}} = {\\left( {\\frac{512}{125}} \\right)^{5}} \\)</span></p>\n\n<p>⇒ 3 + k = 5 ⇒ k = 2</p>\n",
