      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>8<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 64</p>\n\n<p>(0.08)<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 0.0064</p>\n\n<p>&there4;&nbsp;<strong>&radic;<span style=\"\">0.0064 = 0.08</span></strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">15<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 225</span></p>\n\n<p>&there4; <strong>&radic;2.25 = 1.5</strong></p>\n\n<p>17<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 289</p>\n\n<p>&there4; <strong>&radic;2.89 = 1.7</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>&rArr;&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">0.08 + 1.5 + 1.7 =&nbsp; 3.28</span></p>\n",
