      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">(5 × 5 × 5 × 5 × 5 )<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">5</span> × (5 × 5 × 5)<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">5 </span>÷ 5 = (125)<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">?</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ (5 × 5 × 5)<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">5</span> × (5 × 5)<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">5</span> × (125)<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">5</span> ÷ 5 = (125)<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">?</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ (125)<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">5 + 5</span> × <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{5^5\\times 5^5}{5}\\)</span> = (125)<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">?</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ (125)<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">10</span> × 125 × 125 × 5<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">1</span> × 5<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> = (125)<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">?</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ (125)<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">10 + 2 + 1</span> = (125)<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">?</span> ⇒ (125)<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">13</span> = (125)<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">?</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">∴ The correct answer is 13.</span></p>\n",
