      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p>(256)<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">0.16</span>&nbsp;&times; (256)<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">0.09</span>&nbsp;= ?</p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>(256)<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">0.16</span>&nbsp;&times; (256)<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">0.09</span>&nbsp;= ?</p>\n\n<p>Let the unknown number be x.</p>\n\n<p>&rArr;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">(256)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">0.16</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;&times; (256)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">0.09</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;= x</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">(256)<sup>(</sup></span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">0.16 + 0.09)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;= x&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">(256)<sup>0.25</sup></span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;= x</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr; x =&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">(4<sup>4</sup>)<sup>1/4</sup></span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;= 4</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>&there4;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">(256)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">0.16</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;&times; (256)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">0.09</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;= 4</span></strong></p>\n",
