    {
      "id": "6abbeb168ea2-q6",
      "number": 6,
      "question": "If 125 2 &times; (625) -0.25 = 5 x , then the value of x is",
      "questionHtml": "If 125<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;&times; (625)<sup>-0.25</sup>&nbsp;= 5<sup>x</sup>, then the value of x is",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "4",
          "html": "4"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "5",
          "html": "5"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "6",
          "html": "6"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "7",
          "html": "7"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Concept used:</strong></p>\n\n<p>a<sup>b</sup>&nbsp;&times; a<sup>c</sup>&nbsp;= a<sup>b + c</sup></p>\n\n<p>If a<sup>b</sup>&nbsp;= a<sup>c</sup>&nbsp;then b = c</p>\n\n<p>(a<sup>b</sup>)<sup>c</sup>&nbsp;= a<sup>b&nbsp;&times; c</sup></p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>125<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>&nbsp;&times; (625)<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">-0.25</span>&nbsp;= 5<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">x</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 5<sup>3</sup><sup>&nbsp;&times; 2</sup>&nbsp;&times; 5<sup>4&nbsp;</sup><sup>&times; -0.25&nbsp;</sup>= 5<sup>x</sup></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 5<sup>6&nbsp;</sup>&times; 5<sup>-1</sup>&nbsp;= 5<sup>x</sup></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 5<sup>6</sup><sup>&nbsp;- 1</sup>&nbsp;= 5<sup>x</sup></p>\n\n<p>&rArr;&nbsp;5<sup>5</sup>&nbsp;= 5<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">x</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; x = 5</p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "6abbeb168ea2-q7",
      "number": 7,
      "question": "Find the value of &lsquo;x&rsquo; in the following question? (2 3 ) 9 &times; (2 8 ) 5 &divide; (2 6 ) 7 = 2 x",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Find the value of &lsquo;x&rsquo; in the following question?</p>\n(2<sup>3</sup>)<sup>9</sup> &times; (2<sup>8</sup>)<sup>5</sup> &divide; (2<sup>6</sup>)<sup>7</sup> = 2<sup>x</sup>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "25",
          "html": "25"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "29",
          "html": "29"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "57",
          "html": "57"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "109",
          "html": "109"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p><u><strong>Concept:</strong></u></p>\n\n<p><u>Laws</u> of Indices:</p>\n\n<p>1. a<sup>m</sup>&nbsp;&times; a<sup>n&nbsp;</sup>= a<sup>{m + n}</sup></p>\n\n<p>2. a<sup>m&nbsp;</sup>&divide; a<sup>n&nbsp;</sup>= a<sup>{m - n}</sup></p>\n\n<p>3. (a<sup>m</sup>&nbsp;)<sup>n&nbsp;</sup>= a<sup>mn</sup></p>\n\n<p>4. (a)<sup>-m&nbsp;</sup>= 1/a<sup>m</sup></p>\n\n<p>5. (a)<sup>m/n</sup>&nbsp;=&nbsp;<sup>n</sup>&radic;a<sup>m</sup></p>\n\n<p>6. (a)<sup>0&nbsp;</sup>= 1</p>\n\n<p><u><strong>Calculation</strong></u></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; (2<sup>3</sup>)<sup>9</sup> &times; (2<sup>8</sup>)<sup>5</sup> &divide; (2<sup>6</sup>)<sup>7</sup> = 2<sup>x</sup></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; (2)<sup>27</sup> &times; (2)<sup>40</sup> &divide; (2)<sup>42</sup> = 2<sup>x</sup></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; (2)<sup>27 + 40 </sup>&divide; (2)<sup>42</sup> = 2<sup>x</sup></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; (2)<sup>67</sup> &divide; (2)<sup>42</sup> = 2<sup>x</sup></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; (2)<sup>67 &ndash; 42</sup> = 2<sup>x</sup></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; (2)<sup>25</sup> = 2<sup>x</sup></p>\n&there4; x = 25",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
