      "question": "Simplify: \\(\\sqrt{(1191-\\sqrt{(1250-\\sqrt{(599+\\sqrt{676}}))}}\\)",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Simplify:&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\sqrt{(1191-\\sqrt{(1250-\\sqrt{(599+\\sqrt{676}}))}}\\)</span></p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "35",
          "html": "35&nbsp;"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "28",
          "html": "28&nbsp;"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "34",
          "html": "34&nbsp;"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "29",
          "html": "29&nbsp;"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p>The expression to simplify is &radic;((1191-&radic;(1250-&radic;(599+&radic;676))))</p>\n\n<p><strong>Formula Used:</strong></p>\n\n<p>&radic;a means the square root of a.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>Start with the innermost square root: &radic;676</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; &radic;676 = 26</p>\n\n<p>Then, 599 + 26 = 625</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; &radic;(599 + &radic;676) = &radic;625 = 25</p>\n\n<p>Next, 1250 - 25 = 1225</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; &radic;(1250 - &radic;(599 + &radic;676)) = &radic;1225 = 35</p>\n\n<p>Finally, 1191 - 35 = 1156</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; &radic;(1191 - &radic;(1250 - &radic;(599 + &radic;676))) = &radic;1156 = 34</p>\n\n<p><strong>&there4; The simplified result of the given expression is 34.</strong></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
